</span></td>
<td id="A4.T4.10.1.31.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A4.T4.10.1.31.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:51.7pt;">
